id: pm-jev-0s07
title: Name evaluation source failures and support local tracker reads without GitHub
description: "Classify gh source-inspection failures with redacted first-line diagnostics and exact recovery steps; exercise eval and calibrate against eligible local trackers without gh or git, preserve label eligibility and isolated public-source guards. Related implementation: pm-jev-82ip, pm-jev-hx9w, pm-jev-f4ba."
